  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- Int&apos;l Centre Janitorial and Sanitation Skills Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Centre for Environmental Health &amp; Development, through a competitive application process, was chosen to receive grant financing from USADF and LSETF. International Centre for Environmental Health &amp; Development is proposing training in infection prevention and janitorial sanitation for 90 unemployed Lagos State residents. They will train 3 batches of 30 students over an 8 week curriculum leading to employment opportunities in a variety of industries.</narrative>
  </description>
